CHANGES IN VERSION 0.99.4 (2026-09)
-------------------------

    o new function `seqGDS2PGEN()` for the conversion from SeqArray GDS to
      PLINK2 PGEN (pgen, pvar and psam files), including multiallelic
      genotypes and hardcall phase

    o `seqPGEN2GDS()` stores the psam columns FID, PAT, MAT, SEX and the
      phenotypes in 'sample.annotation'

    o fix `seqReadPVAR()` when 'pvar' is an object returned from
      pgenlibr::NewPvar()


CHANGES IN VERSION 0.99.1 (2026-04)
-------------------------

    o new option 'sample.sel' in `seqPGEN2GDS()`

    o pgen2gds was submitted to Bioconductor


CHANGES IN VERSION 0.99.0 (2025-06)
-------------------------

    o first release of pgen2gds
